  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Growth Nepal-Implementation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GGN will support the Government of Nepal (GoN) to: i. Strengthen sustainable economic policy and improve Foreign Direct Investment (FDI) to drive green growth. ii. Support city governments to attract and implement climate-resilient investment projects. iii. Underpin Nepal&#x2019;s green growth by deepening the financial sector and mobilising private climate finance.</narrative>
  </description>
